  _nodes:
  - _nodeId: greeting
    _speakerName: Eadric
    _portrait: {fileID: 0}
    _text: Oswin sent you? Bad timing -- my shelves are bare. The farm's short-handed
      and nothing's coming in. Would you head out to the fields and lend a hand?
      Carrots, grapes, lemons -- harvest what you can, and replant some for next
      season.
